atom_style  atomic
boundary    p p p

read_data   Ta_small.lmp

pair_style  zero 6.01
pair_coeff  * *

compute snapg all snap 6.0 0.99363 6 0.5 1.0 rmin0 0.0 bzeroflag 0 quadraticflag 0

run         0


